{"content": "**BBK BANK**  \nBank of Bahrain and Kuwait  \n**Customer Data Handling Procedure**  \n*Internal Policy Document — Confidential*  \n| **Document ID**   | BBK-CSD-002             |\n|-------------------|-------------------------|\n| **Version**       | 2.3                     |\n| **Date**          | June 2022               |\n| **Status**        | Active                  |\n| **Owner**         | Retail Banking Division |  \nThis procedure provides guidance to Retail Banking staff on handling customer data in day-to-day operations. It should be read alongside the BBK Customer Service Standards.", "node_id": "6cd84b5ee7111a4dc09e71bfeb7d4427", "article_ref": "Section_1", "section_title": "Section_1", "hierarchy_path": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "chunk_id": "Section_1_a0d475_s0_1", "section_level": "article", "chunk_index": 0, "chunk_total": 12, "parent_chunk_id": "", "embed_skip": false, "is_obligation": false, "chunk_type": "general", "jurisdiction": "Bbk", "regulation_name": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_title": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_type": "Internal Policy", "issuing_authority": "", "effective_date": "", "publication_date": "", "last_updated": "", "language": "English", "scope_summary": "", "source_url": "", "tokens": 123}
{"content": "For the purposes of this procedure, customer data includes: names, addresses, contact numbers, email addresses, account numbers, and transaction history. This procedure applies to all Retail Banking staff.", "node_id": "7a895c337cfd5e10296c73b67a907b73", "article_ref": "1. What is Customer Data?", "section_title": "1. What is Customer Data?", "hierarchy_path": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY > 1. What is Customer Data?", "chunk_id": "1_What_is_Customer_Data_998ca9_s1_1", "section_level": "article", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_total": 12, "parent_chunk_id": "", "embed_skip": false, "is_obligation": false, "chunk_type": "general", "jurisdiction": "Bbk", "regulation_name": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_title": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_type": "Internal Policy", "issuing_authority": "", "effective_date": "", "publication_date": "", "last_updated": "", "language": "English", "scope_summary": "", "source_url": "", "tokens": 37}
{"content": "Customer data held by the Retail Banking Division is classified as Internal Use Only. This means it should be kept within the bank but does not require the same level of restriction as strictly confidential information.", "node_id": "e1ffd371c9f7ad1e2cb5bb879567da1d", "article_ref": "2. Data Classification", "section_title": "2. Data Classification", "hierarchy_path": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY > 2. Data Classification", "chunk_id": "2_Data_Classification_dc87db_s2_1", "section_level": "article", "chunk_index": 2, "chunk_total": 12, "parent_chunk_id": "", "embed_skip": false, "is_obligation": false, "chunk_type": "general", "jurisdiction": "Bbk", "regulation_name": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_title": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_type": "Internal Policy", "issuing_authority": "", "effective_date": "", "publication_date": "", "last_updated": "", "language": "English", "scope_summary": "", "source_url": "", "tokens": 38}
{"content": "- Customer records should be saved in the shared Retail Banking drive under the relevant customer folder.\n- Physical documents may be kept in desk drawers or filing cabinets in the branch.\n- Staff should avoid saving customer data to personal devices where possible.", "node_id": "f553bcee2e5602f82abf58d5bd665052", "article_ref": "3. Storing Customer Data", "section_title": "3. Storing Customer Data", "hierarchy_path": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY > 3. Storing Customer Data", "chunk_id": "3_Storing_Customer_Data_4a090b_s3_1", "section_level": "article", "chunk_index": 3, "chunk_total": 12, "parent_chunk_id": "", "embed_skip": false, "is_obligation": false, "chunk_type": "general", "jurisdiction": "Bbk", "regulation_name": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_title": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_type": "Internal Policy", "issuing_authority": "", "effective_date": "", "publication_date": "", "last_updated": "", "language": "English", "scope_summary": "", "source_url": "", "tokens": 47}
{"content": "From time to time, staff may need to share customer data with other parties. The following guidance applies:", "node_id": "ac13ca80a866face6df3edc8e6b6a681", "article_ref": "4. Sharing Customer Data", "section_title": "4. Sharing Customer Data", "hierarchy_path": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY > 4. Sharing Customer Data", "chunk_id": "4_Sharing_Customer_Data_414974_s4_1", "section_level": "article", "chunk_index": 4, "chunk_total": 12, "parent_chunk_id": "", "embed_skip": false, "is_obligation": false, "chunk_type": "general", "jurisdiction": "Bbk", "regulation_name": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_title": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_type": "Internal Policy", "issuing_authority": "", "effective_date": "", "publication_date": "", "last_updated": "", "language": "English", "scope_summary": "", "source_url": "", "tokens": 21}
{"content": "Customer data may be shared freely with colleagues within the Retail Banking Division and with other BBK divisions where there is a business need.", "node_id": "961bd8f4eb58c762c587bc44322f03a0", "article_ref": "4.1 Internal Sharing", "section_title": "4.1 Internal Sharing", "hierarchy_path": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY > 4. Sharing Customer Data > 4.1 Internal Sharing", "chunk_id": "4_1_Internal_Sharing_011be2_s5_1", "section_level": "article", "chunk_index": 5, "chunk_total": 12, "parent_chunk_id": "", "embed_skip": false, "is_obligation": false, "chunk_type": "general", "jurisdiction": "Bbk", "regulation_name": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_title": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_type": "Internal Policy", "issuing_authority": "", "effective_date": "", "publication_date": "", "last_updated": "", "language": "English", "scope_summary": "", "source_url": "", "tokens": 26}
{"content": "Sharing customer data with affiliated BBK group companies (e.g., BBK Kuwait, BBK India) does not require a formal agreement as these are part of the same corporate group.", "node_id": "6a33edd1111ff5172c6156e4c243c6f7", "article_ref": "4.2 Sharing with Group Companies", "section_title": "4.2 Sharing with Group Companies", "hierarchy_path": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY > 4. Sharing Customer Data > 4.2 Sharing with Group Companies", "chunk_id": "4_2_Sharing_with_Group_Compani_9cc6c0_s6_1", "section_level": "article", "chunk_index": 6, "chunk_total": 12, "parent_chunk_id": "", "embed_skip": false, "is_obligation": false, "chunk_type": "general", "jurisdiction": "Bbk", "regulation_name": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_title": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_type": "Internal Policy", "issuing_authority": "", "effective_date": "", "publication_date": "", "last_updated": "", "language": "English", "scope_summary": "", "source_url": "", "tokens": 37}
{"content": "If customer data needs to be shared externally (e.g., with a vendor or service provider), staff should send it via email with a note marking it as confidential. Approval from a line manager is recommended.", "node_id": "30c2ee2faba48e103c2dfb856baf559b", "article_ref": "4.3 External Sharing", "section_title": "4.3 External Sharing", "hierarchy_path": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY > 4. Sharing Customer Data > 4.3 External Sharing", "chunk_id": "4_3_External_Sharing_1786b0_s7_1", "section_level": "article", "chunk_index": 7, "chunk_total": 12, "parent_chunk_id": "", "embed_skip": false, "is_obligation": false, "chunk_type": "general", "jurisdiction": "Bbk", "regulation_name": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_title": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_type": "Internal Policy", "issuing_authority": "", "effective_date": "", "publication_date": "", "last_updated": "", "language": "English", "scope_summary": "", "source_url": "", "tokens": 41}
{"content": "Customer records should be retained for as long as they are commercially useful or until the customer relationship ends. After this point, data may be archived or deleted at the discretion of the branch manager.", "node_id": "677f7c291851a793c2b5fb2b2e7a63a2", "article_ref": "5. Data Retention", "section_title": "5. Data Retention", "hierarchy_path": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY > 5. Data Retention", "chunk_id": "5_Data_Retention_ae1a30_s8_1", "section_level": "article", "chunk_index": 8, "chunk_total": 12, "parent_chunk_id": "", "embed_skip": false, "is_obligation": false, "chunk_type": "general", "jurisdiction": "Bbk", "regulation_name": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_title": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_type": "Internal Policy", "issuing_authority": "", "effective_date": "", "publication_date": "", "last_updated": "", "language": "English", "scope_summary": "", "source_url": "", "tokens": 38}
{"content": "If a customer requests a copy of their data or asks for it to be updated or deleted, staff should try to assist where possible. Requests should be handled within a reasonable period.", "node_id": "4cf3639a7cf343223c128fdc29d4d437", "article_ref": "6. Customer Requests for Their Data", "section_title": "6. Customer Requests for Their Data", "hierarchy_path": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY > 6. Customer Requests for Their Data", "chunk_id": "6_Customer_Requests_for_Their__90c90a_s9_1", "section_level": "article", "chunk_index": 9, "chunk_total": 12, "parent_chunk_id": "", "embed_skip": false, "is_obligation": false, "chunk_type": "general", "jurisdiction": "Bbk", "regulation_name": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_title": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_type": "Internal Policy", "issuing_authority": "", "effective_date": "", "publication_date": "", "last_updated": "", "language": "English", "scope_summary": "", "source_url": "", "tokens": 36}
{"content": "If customer data is accidentally shared with the wrong person or lost, staff should inform their line manager as soon as they are aware. The manager will decide on next steps.", "node_id": "fa886da6c3861631a6c164f590373cc6", "article_ref": "7. Data Incidents", "section_title": "7. Data Incidents", "hierarchy_path": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY > 7. Data Incidents", "chunk_id": "7_Data_Incidents_e57a0e_s10_1", "section_level": "article", "chunk_index": 10, "chunk_total": 12, "parent_chunk_id": "", "embed_skip": false, "is_obligation": false, "chunk_type": "general", "jurisdiction": "Bbk", "regulation_name": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_title": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_type": "Internal Policy", "issuing_authority": "", "effective_date": "", "publication_date": "", "last_updated": "", "language": "English", "scope_summary": "", "source_url": "", "tokens": 34}
{"content": "For any questions about this procedure, please contact the Retail Banking Division Head or your branch manager.  \n*Approved by: Head of Retail Banking, June 2022. Legal review: N/A.*", "node_id": "91c720783160365b2cf57b2416e3c1b7", "article_ref": "8. Questions", "section_title": "8. Questions", "hierarchy_path": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY > 8. Questions", "chunk_id": "8_Questions_8c7ef5_s11_1", "section_level": "article", "chunk_index": 11, "chunk_total": 12, "parent_chunk_id": "", "embed_skip": false, "is_obligation": false, "chunk_type": "general", "jurisdiction": "Bbk", "regulation_name": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_title": "BBK-CSD-002_Customer_Data_Handling_Procedure_CONTRADICTORY", "doc_type": "Internal Policy", "issuing_authority": "", "effective_date": "", "publication_date": "", "last_updated": "", "language": "English", "scope_summary": "", "source_url": "", "tokens": 40}
